    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Earnest are delighted to present No. 23 The Schooner to the market. This beautifully presented one-bedroom apartment has been fully refurbished to an exceptional standard, with meticulous attention to detail throughout. Situated on the first floor (no lift) of the mature and sought-after Alverno development beside Dublin Bay, the property combines a stylish interior with a practical layout. It benefits from recently installed windows (less than five years old), a new combi boiler, open fireplace, new flooring throughout, new internal shaker doors and designated parking, to name but a few. The property will appeal to both homeowners and investors, with the added benefit of not being subject to a rental cap.\r\n\r\nThe bright living room features an open fireplace, recessed lighting, dual light and blackout blinds, and two windows. Bespoke glass panels have been fitted to the deep window sills and alcove shelving, adding a contemporary touch.\r\n\r\nThe stylish kitchen has been designed to maximise the available space and includes a dishwasher, washing/ drying machine, electric hob and oven and fridge freezer. The kitchen is finished with grey fleck ceramic floor tiles, contrasting white wall tiles with black grout, white wall and floor-mounted units, a marble-effect worktop and granite window sills, complemented by recessed lighting. A kitchen window offers natural light and ventilation. \r\n\r\nThe bedroom is cleverly laid out to maximise space and features recessed lighting and dual blinds with both light-filtering and blackout options.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully appointed bathroom features large grey ceramic floor tiles with contrasting white wall tiles and black grout, a shower enclosure with rainfall and handheld showerheads, hidden cistern, floating vanity unit and floating shelves. Further features include a wall-mounted smart glass cabinet with sensor-activated lighting and shaving point, wall-mounted radiator and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nThe refurbishment has been completed to a high standard throughout, including quality carpets, new internal shaker doors, upgraded light fittings and fixtures, chrome light switches with dimmers, a new alarm system and chrome air vents. The attention to detail is evident throughout, creating a stylish and contemporary home in a mature coastal setting.\r\n\r\nLocated in a prime neighborhood, the apartment is surrounded by conveniences, from local markets to trendy cafes, ensuring that you're never far from the heartbeat of the city. And when it's time to venture out, take a stroll along the coast or a walk through St Anne's park . Easy access to public transportation such as busy bus corridors and Clontarf train station offering major thoroughfares make exploration a breeze. Don't miss the opportunity to make this meticulously presented apartment your own. Arrange a viewing today!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - 1.9m x .95m : new carpet \r\n\r\nLiving & Dining – 4.40m x 3.10m: Dual aspect, new carpets, recessed lighting, dimmer switches, dual light and blackout blinds, decorative mantlepiece, bespoke glass panel inserts to window sills and alcove shelving.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 3.10m x 2.05m: New fully fitted kitchen, white wall and floor-mounted units, marble-effect worktop, granite window sills, integrated dishwasher, washing machine, electric hob and oven, fridge freezer, large grey fleck ceramic floor tiles, contrasting white tiled backsplash with black grout, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom – 2.99m x 2.10m: Double bedroom, built-in wardrobes, new carpet, recessed lighting, dual light and blackout blinds.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.40m x 1.75m: Fully refurbished, large grey ceramic floor tiles, contrasting white wall tiles with black grout, shower enclosure, rainfall and handheld showerheads, hidden cistern, floating vanity unit, floating shelves, wall-mounted smart glass cabinet with sensor-activated lighting and shaving point, wall-mounted radiator, recessed lighting."
      },
